msgid ""
"**Taku** (Dyna / DVT1) is also in-tree on `feature/agilex` at "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description)."
