"Control is `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` with "
"`robot:=taku` ([package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)"
" §3.1 / §3.2) — not `demo.launch.py`. Public mock is "
"**`split_body.launch.py`**; **`full_body.launch.py`** needs the private "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` submodule. It is **not** a row in that branch’s "
"README brand tables. There is no lean `open-deploy-ws` Taku branch — "
"[open-deploy-ws Setup](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Taku**（Dyna / DVT1）也在 `feature/agilex` 仓内 "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description)。可视化用"
" `robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku`。控制用 "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py`，并传 `robot:=taku`（[包 "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
